{"purpose":"R16 content/design reference; not an executable Android UI","html":"\n  <main class=\"map-shell\" data-atlas=\"true\" data-ui-theme=\"luxe-ocean\" data-load-state=\"loading\" data-network-state=\"online\" aria-busy=\"true\">\n    <div id=\"map\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Kurdistan geographic map\"></div>\n    <div class=\"map-focus-vignette\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"map-edge-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span></div>\n    <div id=\"mapLoading\" class=\"map-loading\" data-phase=\"loading\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"map-loading__content\">\n        <div class=\"map-loading__word\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span><span class=\"map-loading__slice\"><b>Loading</b></span>\n          <span class=\"map-loading__line\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"map-loading__equation\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-label=\"2 plus 2 equals 1\">2 + 2 = 1</p>\n        <button id=\"mapLoadingRetry\" class=\"map-loading__retry\" type=\"button\" hidden>دووبارە هەوڵدان</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"appHealth\" class=\"app-health\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></div>\n\n    <header class=\"topbar\" aria-label=\"Map header\">\n      <div id=\"mapStatus\" class=\"map-status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-state=\"loading\">\n        <span class=\"map-status__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span>خەریکی ئامادەکردن</span>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"mapOnlineIndicator\" class=\"map-online-indicator\" aria-live=\"polite\" title=\"Online now\">\n        <span class=\"map-online-indicator__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/07.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></span>\n        <span id=\"mapOnlineIndicatorLabel\" class=\"visually-hidden\">ئۆنلاین</span>\n        <strong id=\"mapOnlineIndicatorCount\">0</strong>\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"brandAboutButton\" class=\"brand-card\" type=\"button\" aria-labelledby=\"brandTitle brandSubtitle brandActionAssistive\" aria-controls=\"aboutDialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n        <span class=\"brand-card__aura\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <img class=\"brand-card__logo\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/icons/nav-kurd-logo.png\" alt=\"NAV KURD logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" />\n        <span class=\"brand-card__copy\"><strong id=\"brandTitle\">NAV KURD</strong><span id=\"brandSubtitle\">نەخشەیەکی سەربەخۆ بۆ باشووری کوردستان</span></span>\n        <span id=\"brandActionAssistive\" class=\"visually-hidden\">About</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-card__hint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><path d=\"M12 10.7v5.1M12 7.7h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </button>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"search-card\" data-component=\"aurora-search\" aria-labelledby=\"searchRegionHeading\">\n      <h2 id=\"searchRegionHeading\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Search Kurdistan map</h2>\n      <label class=\"search-card__icon\" for=\"placeSearch\"><span id=\"searchLabelText\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Open search</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10.7\" cy=\"10.7\" r=\"6.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"m16 16 4.2 4.2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></label>\n      <input id=\"placeSearch\" type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"گەڕان بۆ گوند، شەقام، بانک یان هەر شوێنێک…\" aria-label=\"Search village, street or place\" />\n      <button id=\"clearSearch\" class=\"search-card__clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Clear search\" hidden><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"m7 7 10 10M17 7 7 17\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></button>\n      <div id=\"searchResults\" class=\"search-results\" hidden role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"Search results\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <aside class=\"map-actions\" aria-label=\"Map controls\">\n      <div class=\"style-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Map style\">\n        <button id=\"mapModeCycleButton\" class=\"style-choice is-active\" type=\"button\" data-map-mode=\"night\" data-map-mode-cycle=\"true\" aria-pressed=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"style-choice__icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg data-map-mode-icon=\"street\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M12 2.5v2.2m0 14.6v2.2M2.5 12h2.2m14.6 0h2.2M5.3 5.3l1.6 1.6m10.2 10.2 1.6 1.6m0-13.4-1.6 1.6M6.9 17.1l-1.6 1.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n            <svg data-map-mode-icon=\"night\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M19.6 15.1A8 8 0 0 1 8.9 4.4 8.1 8.1 0 1 0 19.6 15.1Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n            <img data-map-mode-icon=\"satellite\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/a2.svg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\" />\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"style-choice__label visually-hidden\" data-map-mode-label>Night</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"actionsToggleButton\" class=\"round-button map-actions__toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"More map controls\" aria-expanded=\"false\" title=\"More map controls\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.65\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.65\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.65\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></button>\n      <button id=\"baseMapButton\" class=\"map-button is-active map-button--logo\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" title=\"Roads, water and places\"><img class=\"map-button__logo\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/icons/nav-kurd-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" draggable=\"false\" /><span id=\"baseMapText\">Map data</span></button>\n      <button id=\"layersButton\" class=\"round-button is-active\" type=\"button\" title=\"Administrative layers\" aria-label=\"Toggle administrative layers\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/03.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n      <button id=\"placesButton\" class=\"round-button is-active\" type=\"button\" title=\"Places and checkpoints\" aria-label=\"Toggle places and checkpoints\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/04.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n      <button id=\"userAccountButton\" class=\"round-button user-account-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Account and contributions\" aria-label=\"Account and contributions\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/profile.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /><span class=\"user-account-button__dot\" hidden></span></button>\n      <button id=\"ownerStudioButton\" class=\"round-button owner-studio-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Administrator tools\" aria-label=\"Administrator tools\" hidden><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/a1.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n      <button id=\"routePinButton\" class=\"round-button route-pin-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Set destination pin\" aria-label=\"Set destination pin\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/05.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n      <button id=\"locateButton\" class=\"round-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Show my location\" aria-label=\"Show my location\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/06.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n      <button id=\"shareLocationButton\" class=\"round-button native-share-location\" type=\"button\" title=\"Share my location\" aria-label=\"Share my location\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><path d=\"m8.3 10.9 7.4-4.6M8.3 13.1l7.4 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></button>\n      <button id=\"fitButton\" class=\"round-button\" type=\"button\" title=\"Show Kurdistan Region\" aria-label=\"Show Kurdistan Region\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/09.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n    </aside>\n\n    <button id=\"threeDButton\" class=\"map-3d-button\" data-control-kind=\"camera-3d\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"3D view\" title=\"3D view\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/01.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n    <button id=\"controlsVisibilityButton\" class=\"controls-visibility-button\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Hide map controls\" title=\"Hide map controls\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/02.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></button>\n\n    <button id=\"feedbackQuickButton\" class=\"feedback-quick-button\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Feedback and issue report\" title=\"Feedback and issue report\"><span class=\"feedback-quick-button__pulse\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/08.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Feedback</span></button>\n\n    <section id=\"mapSheet\" class=\"map-sheet\" aria-labelledby=\"mapTitle\" data-sheet-state=\"expanded\">\n      <button id=\"sheetToggle\" class=\"sheet-handle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"sheetContent\">\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"sheetHandleText\" class=\"sheet-handle__text\">وردەکاری ماپ</span>\n      </button>\n      <div id=\"mapAttributionSlot\" class=\"map-sheet__attribution-slot\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      <div class=\"sheet-header\"><div class=\"sheet-header__copy\"><p id=\"regionEyebrow\" class=\"eyebrow\">KURDISTAN REGION</p><h1 id=\"mapTitle\">نەخشەی کوردستان</h1></div><div class=\"sheet-icon\"><img src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/icons/nav-kurd-logo.png\" alt=\"NAV KURD logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" /></div></div>\n      <div id=\"sheetContent\" class=\"sheet-content\">\n      <p id=\"mapMessage\" class=\"map-message\" role=\"status\">خەریکە داتای ڕاستەقینەی ماپەکە بار دەکرێت.</p>\n      <div class=\"map-stats\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Map dataset details\"><div><strong id=\"localityCount\">—</strong><span id=\"localityStatLabel\">شوێن</span></div><div><strong id=\"baseSearchCount\">—</strong><span id=\"baseSearchStatLabel\">داتای گەڕان</span></div><div><strong id=\"ownerPlaceCount\">—</strong><span id=\"ownerPlaceStatLabel\">شوێنی زیادکراو</span></div></div>\n      <div class=\"action-grid\"><button id=\"sheetLocateButton\" class=\"action-card\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"action-card__icon action-card__icon--tracking\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/06.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></span><span><strong id=\"locateTitle\">شوێنی من</strong><small id=\"locateSub\">شوێنی ئێستا و جوڵە</small></span></button><button id=\"sheetFitButton\" class=\"action-card\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"action-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"nav-ui-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/nav-kurd/09.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" draggable=\"false\" /></span><span><strong id=\"fitTitle\">تەواوی هەرێم</strong><small id=\"fitSub\">گەڕانەوە بۆ سنوور</small></span></button><button id=\"sheetShareLocationButton\" class=\"action-card action-card--native-share\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"action-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><path d=\"m8.3 10.9 7.4-4.6M8.3 13.1l7.4 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></span><span><strong id=\"shareLocationTitle\">هاوبەشکردنی شوێن</strong><small id=\"shareLocationSub\">لینکی شوێنی ئێستا</small></span></button></div>\n      <div class=\"utility-row\"><div class=\"segmented\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Language\"><button data-language=\"ku\" class=\"is-active\" type=\"button\">کوردی</button><button data-language=\"ar\" type=\"button\">عربي</button><button data-language=\"en\" type=\"button\">EN</button></div><span id=\"backendState\" class=\"backend-state\">داتای ناوخۆیی</span></div>\n      <p id=\"mapNote\" class=\"map-note\">ماپەکە ڕێگا، شەقام، گوند، شار، سنوور و شوێنە گرنگەکانی هەرێمی کوردستان پیشان دەدات.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div id=\"aboutDialog\" class=\"about-dialog\" hidden>\n      <section class=\"about-dialog__panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"aboutTitle\" aria-describedby=\"aboutDescription\">\n        <span class=\"about-dialog__aurora\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <div class=\"about-dialog__scroll\">\n        <div class=\"about-dialog__close-row\">\n          <button id=\"aboutCloseButton\" class=\"dialog-close-button about-dialog__close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close about panel\">\n            <svg class=\"dialog-close-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m7 7 10 10M17 7 7 17\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"about-dialog__brand\">\n          <span class=\"about-dialog__logo\"><img src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/icons/nav-kurd-logo.png\" alt=\"NAV KURD logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" /></span>\n          <div><p id=\"aboutEyebrow\">NAV KURD</p><h2 id=\"aboutTitle\">Kurdistan Atlas</h2></div>\n        </div>\n        <figure class=\"about-dialog__cover\">\n          <img src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/promo/nav-kurd-v9-cover.jpg\" alt=\"NAV KURD 9.1.0 application showcase\" width=\"1536\" height=\"910\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\" />\n          <figcaption><span>NAV KURD 9.1.0</span><strong>Built for Kurdistan. Native on Android. Fast on the web.</strong></figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <p id=\"aboutDescription\" class=\"about-dialog__description\">A modern geographic atlas for roads, places, navigation, GPS and satellite context across the Kurdistan Region.</p>\n        <dl class=\"about-dialog__meta\">\n          <div><dt id=\"aboutVersionLabel\">Version</dt><dd>9.1.0</dd></div>\n          <div><dt id=\"aboutMapEditionLabel\">Map edition</dt><dd id=\"aboutMapEditionValue\">2027</dd></div>\n          <div><dt id=\"aboutDeveloperLabel\">Developer</dt><dd class=\"about-dialog__developer\"><span>SARHANG IO</span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sarhang.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Instagram — SARHANG IO\"><img src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/icons/social/instagram.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" /></a></dd></div>\n          <div><dt id=\"aboutCvLabel\">MY CV</dt><dd><a id=\"aboutCvLink\" class=\"about-dialog__meta-link about-dialog__meta-link--cv\" href=\"https://sarhang-cs.github.io/Sarhang-Cv/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"MY CV\"><img class=\"about-dialog__meta-icon\" src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/support/my-cv-preview.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1120\" height=\"1680\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\" /></a></dd></div>\n          <div><dt id=\"aboutCoverageLabel\">Coverage</dt><dd id=\"aboutCoverageValue\">Kurdistan Region + disputed areas</dd></div>\n        </dl>\n        <section id=\"offlineMapPack\" class=\"offline-map-pack\" data-status=\"idle\" data-progress-phase=\"start\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-labelledby=\"offlineMapPackHeading\">\n          <h3 id=\"offlineMapPackHeading\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Offline map pack</h3>\n          <div class=\"offline-map-pack__header\">\n            <div><strong id=\"offlinePackTitle\">Offline map</strong><small id=\"offlinePackStatus\">Not downloaded</small></div>\n            <span id=\"offlinePackSize\">0 MB</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"offline-map-pack__track\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Offline map download\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"0\"><span id=\"offlinePackProgress\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"offline-map-pack__meta\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n            <span id=\"offlinePackPersistence\">—</span>\n            <span id=\"offlinePackStorage\">—</span>\n          </div>\n          <p id=\"offlinePackNote\" class=\"offline-map-pack__note\">Download this section once so the app runs better and faster on your device.</p>\n          <div class=\"offline-map-pack__actions\">\n            <button id=\"offlinePackDownload\" type=\"button\">Download</button>\n            <button id=\"offlinePackPause\" type=\"button\" hidden>Pause</button>\n            <button id=\"offlinePackResume\" type=\"button\" hidden>Resume</button>\n            <button id=\"offlinePackDelete\" type=\"button\" hidden>Delete</button>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n        <section id=\"androidDownloadSection\" class=\"android-download\" aria-labelledby=\"androidDownloadTitle\">\n          <span class=\"android-download__sky\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>\n          <div class=\"android-download__heading\">\n            <span class=\"android-download__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <img src=\"navkurd-core:///resources/assets/android-app-icon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\" />\n            </span>\n            <div><p>NAV KURD 9.1.0</p><h3 id=\"androidDownloadTitle\">ئەپی Android دابگرە</h3><small id=\"androidDownloadSummary\">وەشانی واژۆکراو و پشتڕاستکراو بۆ Android 7 و نوێتر</small></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"android-download__actions\">\n            <a id=\"androidDirectDownload\" class=\"android-download__primary Download-button\" href=\"navkurd-core:///resources/downloads/NAV-KURD-9.1.0.apk\" download=\"NAV-KURD-9.1.0.apk\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M144 480C64.5 480 0 415.5 0 336c0-62.8 40.2-116.2 96.2-135.9-.1-2.7-.2-5.4-.2-8.1 0-88.4 71.6-160 160-160 59.3 0 111 32.2 138.7 80.2C409.9 102 428.3 96 448 96c53 0 96 43 96 96 0 12.2-2.3 23.8-6.4 34.6C596 2